\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces One human request maps to a median of 2--6 \textsf  {sgt}{} features across four repositories with full transcripts. The bar shows the median; the whisker extends to the maximum observed. A ratio of\nonbreakingspace 1 would mean each request lands in exactly one feature. The consistently above-1 ratio means the operations of Section\nonbreakingspace \ref {sec:design} require the developer to name a unit smaller than what they asked for.}}{42}{figure.caption.59}\protected@file@percent }
